From 959cfd0c4bb698b2bef548f55169485bad69f3cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tsuji-riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:02:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ARM: add Celestial CNC1800L (D-Link DSM-232) device tree
 support

Add minimal DT based support for the Celestial/Cavium CNC1800L SoC
(ARM1176): machine entry, AHB clock event / APB clock source timer
driver, DW APB ICTL interrupt controller and DW APB UART nodes, a
DSM-232 board DTS, bindings and a defconfig.

Register addresses and IRQ numbers come from the vendor 2.6.32 GPL BSP.
Not tested on hardware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K1YEf8BfFQRcvUTgm7e5vZ
